<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/sesgazetesi.com.tr","name":"Haberler"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/sesgazetesi.com.tr\/siyaset","name":"Siyaset"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/sesgazetesi.com.tr\/yeni-partide-on-secim-heyecani-aydinda-5-aday-yarisiyor","name":"Yeni Parti\u2019de \u00f6n se\u00e7im heyecan\u0131: Ayd\u0131n\u2019da 5 aday yar\u0131\u015f\u0131yor"}}]}</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"NewsArticle","headline":"Yeni Parti\u2019de \u00f6n se\u00e7im heyecan\u0131: Ayd\u0131n\u2019da 5 aday yar\u0131\u015f\u0131yor","articleSection":"Siyaset","dateCreated":"2026-10-18T11:49:00+03:00","datePublished":"2026-10-18T11:49:00+03:00","dateModified":"2026-10-18T11:49:00+03:00","wordCount":200,"genre":"news","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/sesgazetesi.com.tr\/yeni-partide-on-secim-heyecani-aydinda-5-aday-yarisiyor"},"articleBody":"Ayd\u0131n\u2019\u0131n 17 il\u00e7esinde saat 09.00\u2019da ba\u015flayan oy verme i\u015flemi saat 18.00\u2019e kadar s\u00fcrecek. Yakla\u015f\u0131k 19 bin \u00fcyenin oy kullanma hakk\u0131 bulunuyor.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nYeni Parti Ayd\u0131n te\u015fkilat\u0131nda il ba\u015fkan\u0131n\u0131 belirleyecek \u00f6nse\u00e7im heyecan\u0131 ya\u015fan\u0131yor. Bug\u00fcn ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilen se\u00e7imde Barkan Kal\u0131nomuz, Bayram \u0130nci, Dilaver Demir, Kemal G\u00fcneri ve \u0130smet Bozkurt il ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\u00e7in yar\u0131\u015f\u0131yor.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n17 \u0130L\u00c7EDE SANDIK KURULDU\r\n\r\nParti \u00fcyelerinin oy kullanabilmesi i\u00e7in Ayd\u0131n\u2019\u0131n 17 il\u00e7esinde sand\u0131klar kuruldu. Saat 09.00\u2019da ba\u015flayan se\u00e7imde oy verme i\u015flemi 18.00\u2019de sona erecek. Her aday\u0131n g\u00f6zlemcileri il\u00e7elerde g\u00f6rev yaparken mevcut il y\u00f6neticileri de se\u00e7im s\u00fcrecinde sahada bulunuyor. Se\u00e7im divan ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131n Ayd\u0131n merkezde g\u00f6rev yapaca\u011f\u0131 bildirildi.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nEFELER\u2019DE ADRES FAT\u0130H PAZARYER\u0130\r\n\r\nEfeler\u2019deki parti \u00fcyeleri, Fatih Kapal\u0131 Pazaryeri\u2019nde kurulan sand\u0131klarda oy kullan\u0131yor. Ba\u015fkan adaylar\u0131ndan Bayram \u0130nci ve \u0130smet Bozkurt da oylar\u0131n\u0131 Efeler\u2019de kulland\u0131. Yakla\u015f\u0131k 19 bin \u00fcyenin kat\u0131l\u0131m hakk\u0131n\u0131n bulundu\u011fu \u00f6nse\u00e7imde, \u00fcyelerin tercihleri Yeni Parti\u2019nin Ayd\u0131n\u2019daki yeni il ba\u015fkan\u0131n\u0131 belirleyecek.\r\n\r\n","description":"Yeni Parti Ayd\u0131n \u0130l Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\u00e7in d\u00fczenlenen \u00f6nse\u00e7imde 5 aday, \u00fcyelerin deste\u011fini almak i\u00e7in yar\u0131\u015f\u0131yor.","inLanguage":"tr-TR","keywords":[],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/sesgazetesicomtr.teimg.com\/crop\/1280x720\/sesgazetesi-com-tr\/uploads\/2026\/10\/yeni-partide-on-secim-heyecani-aydinda-5-aday-yarisiyor-700405-a894de.jpg","width":"1280","height":"720","caption":"Yeni Parti\u2019de \u00f6n se\u00e7im heyecan\u0131: Ayd\u0131n\u2019da 5 aday yar\u0131\u015f\u0131yor"},"isFamilyFriendly":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","isAccessibleForFree":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/sesgazetesi.com.tr\/#organization","name":"Ayd\u0131n Ses Gazetesi","image":"https:\/\/sesgazetesicomtr.teimg.com\/sesgazetesi-com-tr\/uploads\/2024\/03\/sonlogoses.jpg","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/sesgazetesicomtr.teimg.com\/sesgazetesi-com-tr\/uploads\/2024\/03\/sonlogoses.jpg","width":"640","height":"375"}},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"KAZIM Y\u00d6R\u00dcKCE","url":"https:\/\/sesgazetesi.com.tr\/muhabir\/31\/kazim-yorukce"},"editor":{"@type":"Person","name":"\u00d6mer Araz","url":"https:\/\/sesgazetesi.com.tr\/muhabir\/19\/omer-araz"},"creator":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/sesgazetesi.com.tr\/#organization","name":"Ayd\u0131n Ses Gazetesi","url":"https:\/\/sesgazetesi.com.tr"}}</script>


